s blood through 60,000 miles of vessels. Beats 100,000 times daily, pumping 2,000 gallons of blood.\\\" },\\r\\n        respiratory: { title: \\\"\\ud83e\\udec1 Respiratory System\\\", desc: \\\"Lungs bring oxygen in, remove CO2. 600 million alveoli with surface area of a tennis court.\\\" },\\r\\n        nervous: { title: \\\"\\u26a1 Nervous System\\\", desc: \\\"Brain (86 billion neurons) controls body. Signals travel at 120 meters per second.\\\" },\\r\\n        muscular: { title: \\\"\\ud83d\\udcaa Muscular System\\\", desc: \\\"Over 600 muscles make up 40% of body weight. Heart is hardest working muscle.\\\" },\\r\\n        digestive: { title: \\\"\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Digestive System\\\", desc: \\\"Breaks down food into nutrients. Small intestine is 22 feet long, absorbs 90% of nutrients.\\\" }\\r\\n    };\\r\\n    \\r\\n    document.getElementById(\'modelFrame\').src = models[system];\\r\\n    document.getElementById(\'infoBox\').innerHTML = `<h3 style=\\\"color:#00ffcc;\\\">${info[system].title}<\\/h3><p>${info[system].desc}<\\/p>`;\\r\\n    \\r\\n    const btns = [\'skeletal\',\'circulatory\',\'respiratory\',\'nervous\',\'muscular\',\'digestive\'];\\r\\n    btns.forEach(b => {\\r\\n        const btn = document.getElementById(`btn-${b}`);\\r\\n        if(b === system) {\\r\\n            btn.style.background = \'#0f3460\';\\r\\n            btn.style.boxShadow = \'0 0 15px rgba(0,160,255,0.5)\';\\r\\n        } else {\\r\\n            btn.style.background = \'#1a2a4a\';\\r\\n            btn.style.boxShadow = \'none\';\\r\\n        }\\r\\n    });\\r\\n}\\r\\n<\\/script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(1276,154,'footnotes',''),(1278,152,'_elementor_version','4.1.3'),(1279,152,'_elementor_global_class_usage_indexed','1'),(1280,152,'_elementor_global_class_usage_indexed_preview','1'),(1281,152,'_elementor_migrations_state_d2a1','4.1.3:997ef14e505ddd4af49c620835e30da6'),(1293,156,'footnotes',''),(1294,156,'_elementor_edit_mode','