 #44aa44; color: white; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;\">ΓÜí Nervous System</a>','brain','','inherit','closed','closed','','186-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:32:25','2026-06-15 20:32:25','',186,'http://localhost/biology/?p=197',0,'revision','',0),(198,1,'2026-06-15 20:33:12','2026-06-15 20:33:12','<h1 style=\"color: #44aaff;\">≡ƒ½ü Human Lungs</h1>\n    <p><strong>Scientific Name:</strong> Pulmones</p>\n    <p><strong>Location:</strong> Thorax (chest cavity), on either side of the heart</p>\n        <iframe src=\"https://sketchfab.com/models/a4ad0848e8f34da798d70a71f9237892/embed?autospin=1&autostart=1&preload=1\"\n            style=\"width:100%; height:500px; border:none;\" \n            allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; xr-spatial-tracking\" \n            allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n        <h2>≡ƒôû Functions</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Bring oxygen into the body (inhalation)</li>\n            <li>Remove carbon dioxide from the body (exhalation)</li>\n            <li>Filter small blood clots from the bloodstream</li>\n            <li>Help regulate blood pH</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h2>≡ƒö¼ Main Parts</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li><strong>Trachea (Windpipe):</strong> Carries air to the lungs</li>\n            <li><strong>Bronchi:</strong> Two tubes that branch into each lung</li>\n            <li><strong>Bronchioles:</strong> Smaller branches inside the lungs</li>\n            <li><strong>Alveoli:</strong> Tiny air sacs where gas exchange happens</li>\n            <li><strong>Diaphragm:</strong> Muscle that helps you breathe</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h2>≡ƒÆí Amazing Facts</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Your lungs contain ~600 million alveoli ΓÇô if spread out, they would cover a tennis court!</li>\n            <li>You breathe about 22,000 times per day</li>\n            <li>The left lung is smaller than the right to make room for your heart</li>\n            <li>Lungs are the only organ that can float on water</li>\n            <li>Your lungs produce about 1-2 liters of mucus daily (you swallow it without noticing)</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h2>≡ƒöù Related System</h2>\n        <a href=\"/biology/respiratory-system\" style=\"background: #44aaff; color: white; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;\">≡ƒ½ü Respiratory System</a>','Lungs','','publish','closed','closed','','lungs','','','2026-06-15 20:34:39','2026-06-15 20:34:39','',0,'http://localhost/biology/?page_id=198',0,'page','',0),(200,1,'2026-06-15 20:33:12','2026-06-15 20:33:12','','Lungs','','inherit','closed','closed','','198-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:33:12','2026-06-15 20:33:12','',198,'http://localhost/biology/?p=200',0,'revision','',0),(201,1,'2026-06-15 20:33:25','2026-06-15 20:33:25','<div style=\"max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #e8f4ff;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #44aaff;\">≡ƒ½ü Human Lungs</h1>\n    <p><strong>Scientific Name:</strong> Pulmones</p>\n    <p><strong>Location:</strong> Thorax (chest cavity), on either side of the heart</p>\n\n    <div style=\"background: #000; border-radius: 15px; margin: 20px 0; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <iframe src=\"https://sketchfab.com/models/a4ad0848e8f34da798d70a71f9237892/embed?autospin=1&autostart=1&preload=1\"\n            style=\"width:100%; height:500px; border:none;\" \n            allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; xr-spatial-tracking\" \n            allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px;\">\n        <h2>≡ƒôû Functions</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Bring oxygen into the body (inhalation)</li>\n            <li>Remove carbon dioxide from the body (exhalation)</li>\n            <li>Filter small blood clots from the bloodstream</li>\n            <li>Help regulate blood pH</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2>≡ƒö¼ Main Parts</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li><strong>Trachea (Windpipe):</strong> Carries air to the lungs</li>\n            <li><strong>Bronchi:</strong> Two tubes that branch into each lung</li>\n            <li><strong>Bronchioles:</strong> Smaller branches inside the lungs</li>\n            <li><strong>Alveoli:</strong> Tiny air sacs where gas exchange happens</li>\n            <li><strong>Diaphragm:</strong> Muscle that helps you breathe</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2>≡ƒÆí Amazing Facts</h2>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Your lungs contain ~600 million alveoli ΓÇô if spread out, they would cover a tennis court!</li>\n            <li>You breathe about 22,000 times per day</li>\n            <li>The left lung is smaller than the right to make room for your heart</li>\n            <li>Lungs are the only organ that can float on water</li>\n            <li>Your lungs produce about 1-2 liters of mucus daily (you swallow it without noticing)</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2>≡ƒöù Related System</h2>\n        <a href=\"/biology/respiratory-system\" style=\"background: #44aaff; color: white; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;\">≡ƒ½ü Respiratory System</a>\n    </div>\n</div>','Lungs','','inherit','closed','closed','','198-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:33:25','2026-06-15 20:33:25','',198,'http://localhost/biology/?p=201',0,'revision','',0),(203,1,'2026-06-15 20:33:52','2026-06-15 20:33:52','','Lungs','','inherit','closed','closed','','198-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:33:52','2026-06-15 20:33:52','',198,'http://localhost/biology/?p=203',0,'revision','',0),(204,1,'2026-06-15 20:34:34','2026-06-15 20:34:34','','Lungs','','inherit','closed','closed','','198-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:34:34','2026-06-15 20:34:34','',198,'http://localhost/biology/?p=204',0,'revision','',0),(205,1,'2026-06-15 20:34:35','2026-06-15 20:34:35','','Lungs','','inherit','closed','closed','','198-revision-v1','','','2026-06-15 20:34:35','2026-06-15 20:34:35','',198,'http://l